[
  {
    "content_id": "10048001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我是保罗，我做使徒并非受人委派，也不是倚靠人，而是由耶稣基督和叫祂从死里复活的父上帝委派的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我和所有跟我在一起的弟兄写信给加拉太的各教会。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;愿我们的父上帝和主耶稣基督赐给你们恩典和平安！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;基督遵照我们父上帝的旨意为我们的罪献上了自己，好拯救我们脱离这罪恶的世代。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;愿荣耀归给上帝，直到永永远远。阿们！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我很惊讶，你们竟然那么快就背弃了借着基督的恩典呼召你们的上帝，去追随别的福音！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;其实那并不是福音，只是某些人扰乱你们的信仰，想篡改基督的福音。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;即便是我们或天使，若另传福音给你们，与我们以前传给你们的相悖，也该受咒诅！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我们已经说过，现在我再说一次：如果有人向你们传别的福音，与你们以前接受的相悖，那人该受咒诅！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我现在是要赢得人的赞同吗？还是要赢得上帝的赞同？难道我是要讨好人吗？我如果仍旧要讨好人，就不是基督的奴仆了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;弟兄姊妹，我告诉你们，我传的福音不是出于人的意思，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;因为这福音既不是我从人那里领受的，也不是我跟人学来的，而是耶稣基督亲自启示我的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你们都听说过我信奉犹太教时的所作所为，我怎样残酷地迫害上帝的教会，试图摧毁它。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我在犹太教里比许多同辈的犹太人更进取，狂热地维护祖先的传统。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;然而，当我还在母腹中的时候，上帝就施恩将我分别出来并呼召了我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;上帝既然乐意把祂的儿子启示给我，叫我向外族人传扬祂，我就没有跟任何人商量，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;也没有上耶路撒冷去见那些比我先做使徒的人，而是去了阿拉伯，然后回到大马士革。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;过了三年，我才到耶路撒冷去拜会矶法，和他一起住了十五天。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;我也见了主耶稣的弟弟雅各，此外没有见过其他使徒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;我在上帝面前保证，我写给你们的绝无谎言。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;后来我又到了叙利亚和基利迦地区。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;那时，犹太境内基督的众教会都还没有见过我的面。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;他们只是听说：“那个从前迫害我们的人如今在传扬他曾试图摧毁的信仰。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048001024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 1:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48001024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;于是他们因为我的缘故将荣耀归给上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;十四年后，我和巴拿巴又去耶路撒冷，并带了提多同去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我是遵照上帝的启示去的。我私下拜会了那些有名望的教会领袖，陈明我在外族人中间所传的福音，免得我过去或是现在的努力都白费了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;跟我同去的提多虽然是希腊人，也没有人勉强他接受割礼。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;事情的缘由是因为有一些假信徒偷偷混了进来，要窥探我们在基督耶稣里享有的自由，想叫我们做律法的奴隶。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;但为了叫福音的真理常在你们当中，我们丝毫没有向他们妥协。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;至于那些德高望重的教会领袖，他们的地位对我来说无关紧要，因为上帝不以貌取人。他们对我所传的并没有增加什么。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;相反，他们都已看到，上帝委托我向外族人传福音，就像祂委托彼得向犹太人传福音一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;上帝感动了彼得，呼召他做犹太人的使徒，祂也同样感动了我，呼召我做外族人的使徒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;当时被誉为教会柱石的雅各、矶法和约翰明白了上帝赐给我的恩典之后，就与我和巴拿巴用右手行相交之礼，让我们向外族人传福音，他们向受割礼的人传福音。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;他们只要求我们顾念那些贫困的人，这正是我一向热衷的事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;后来，矶法到了安提阿，因他做错了事，我就当面反对他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;从雅各那里来的人抵达之前，他和外族的信徒一起吃饭。但那些人抵达以后，他因为怕那些坚持行割礼的犹太人批评，就与外族的信徒分开了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;其他犹太基督徒也跟着他装假，甚至连巴拿巴也随从了他们的虚伪。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我看见他们不照福音的真理行，就当众对矶法说：“你身为犹太人，如果行事为人像外族人，不像犹太人，又怎能强迫外族人按犹太人的规矩生活呢？”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;我们生来是犹太人，不是外族罪人，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;但我们知道人被称为义人不是靠遵行律法，而是靠信耶稣基督。所以我们信了基督耶稣，以便因信基督被称为义人，而不是靠遵行律法，因为无人能够靠遵行律法被称为义人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;如果我们寻求在基督里被称为义人，结果却仍是罪人，难道基督助长罪恶吗？当然不是！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;倘若我重建我所拆毁的东西，就表明我是罪人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;其实，我因无法满足律法的要求而向律法死了，使我可以为上帝而活。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;我已经与基督一同被钉在十字架上，现在活着的不再是我，而是基督活在我里面。我如今活在肉身中的生命是靠信上帝的儿子活着，祂爱我，为我舍命。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48002021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;我不废弃上帝的恩典，倘若靠遵行律法可以得到义，基督的死便毫无意义了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;无知的加拉太人啊！谁又蛊惑了你们呢？耶稣基督被钉在十字架上的事，早就像一幅画一样展现在你们眼前了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我只想问，你们领受了圣灵是靠遵行律法呢，还是因为相信所听见的福音呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你们既然靠圣灵开始了基督徒的生活，现在却想靠肉体达到纯全吗？你们就这么无知吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;你们受了许多苦，难道都是徒然的吗？真白受了吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;上帝将圣灵赐给你们，又在你们中间行神迹，是因为你们遵行律法呢，还是因为你们相信所听到的福音呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;圣经上说：“亚伯拉罕信上帝，就被算为义人。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;因此，你们要明白，那些信的人才是亚伯拉罕的子孙。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;圣经早就指明，上帝要叫外族人因信被称为义人，祂预先将福音传给亚伯拉罕，说：“万国必因你而蒙福。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;所以那些信的人必和有信心的亚伯拉罕一同蒙福。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;凡以遵行律法为本的人都在咒诅之下，因为圣经上说：“凡不遵行律法书上一切命令的人必受咒诅。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;非常明显，没有人能靠遵行律法在上帝面前被称为义人，因为圣经上说：“义人必靠信心而活。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;律法并非以信心为本，而是说：“遵行律法的人必因此而活。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;但基督替我们受了咒诅，从而救赎我们脱离了律法的咒诅，因为圣经上说：“凡挂在木头上的人都是受咒诅的。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;这样，赐给亚伯拉罕的福气可以借着基督耶稣临到外族人，使我们也可以借着信得到上帝应许赐给我们的圣灵。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;弟兄姊妹，我举个日常生活中的例子。世人的合约一经双方签订之后，就不能作废，也不能加添。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;上帝曾向亚伯拉罕和他的后裔赐下应许，不过这里没有说“后裔们”——指许多人，而是说“你的后裔”——指一个人，就是基督。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;我的意思是：四百三十年后颁布的律法不会废除上帝先前立下的约，以致应许落空。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;我们如果是靠遵行律法去承受产业，就不是倚靠上帝的应许。但上帝是凭应许把产业赐给了亚伯拉罕。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;那么，为什么会有律法呢？律法是为了使人知罪而增设的，一直存到那位承受应许的后裔来临。律法是通过天使交给一位中保颁布的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;中保代表双方，但上帝则单方面赐下应许。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;这样看来，上帝的律法和上帝的应许是否互相矛盾呢？当然不是！如果颁布的律法能带给人生命，人就可以靠律法得到义了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;但圣经说万物都困在罪的权势下，为要使那些信的人因为信耶稣基督而得到应许。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;信耶稣的时代来临以前，律法暂时监管我们。等到信耶稣之道显明出来后，律法就不再监管了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;因此，律法是我们的监护人，负责引领我们归向基督，使我们可以因信被称为义人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;现在信耶稣的时代已经来临，我们不再受律法监管。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003026",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;你们都借着信基督耶稣而成为上帝的儿女，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003027",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;因为你们受洗归入基督就是披戴基督。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003028",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:28",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003028",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>28</sup>&nbsp;从此不再分犹太人和希腊人，自由人和奴隶，男人和女人，因为你们都在基督耶稣里合而为一了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048003029",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 3:29",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48003029",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>29</sup>&nbsp;你们若属于基督，就是亚伯拉罕的子孙，并且按照上帝的应许是产业继承人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;然而，继承人还年幼时，虽然身为产业的主人，实际上和奴仆没有分别。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;他一样要受监护人和管家的约束，一直到他父亲指定他继承产业的日子为止。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我们也一样，在孩童时期受世界基本规条的辖制。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;然而，时候一到，上帝就差遣自己的儿子借着一位女子降生，并受律法的约束，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;为要救赎一切受律法约束的人，使我们成为祂的儿女。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我们既然成为儿女，上帝就差遣祂儿子的灵进入我们的心里，呼求：“阿爸，父啊！”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;由此可见，你们从今以后不再是奴仆，而是儿女。既然身为儿女，就可以靠着上帝成为产业继承人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;从前，你们不认识上帝，做那些假神的奴隶。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;现在，你们既然认识了上帝，或者更应该说是上帝认识了你们，为什么还要回到那些脆弱无用的基本规条之下，甘愿再做它们的奴隶呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;你们竟然还在拘守什么日子、月份、节期和年份！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我真担心我在你们身上的一番心血都枉费了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;弟兄姊妹，我劝你们现在要像我一样，因为我已经像你们一样。你们向来没有亏待过我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你们知道，当初是因为我生病才有机会首次向你们传福音。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;那时，你们虽然因为我生病而受累，却没有轻视我、嫌弃我，反而接待我，就像接待上帝的天使，接待基督耶稣一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;我可以为你们作证，如果可能的话，你们那时就是把眼睛剜出来给我，也心甘情愿。你们当初的善意哪里去了？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;现在我因为告诉你们真理，就成了你们的仇人吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;那些人非常热心地对待你们，其实他们心怀不轨，想要离间你们和我们的关系，使你们热心地对待他们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;有人热心待你们当然很好，但总要动机纯正、始终如一，不应该只是我和你们在一起时才热心待你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;孩子们，为了你们，我像一位母亲再次经历生产的剧痛，一直到基督的生命在你们里面成形。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;我恨不得立刻赶到你们身边，换种口气说话，因为我为你们困惑不安。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;你们这些甘愿在律法之下的人啊！告诉我，你们没听过律法怎么说吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;律法书上说：亚伯拉罕有两个儿子，一个是婢女生的，一个是主母生的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;婢女的儿子是按着人的意愿生的，主母的儿子是按着上帝的应许生的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;这些事都有寓意，两个妇人代表两个约。夏甲代表颁布于西奈山的约，她生的孩子是奴仆。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;这夏甲代表阿拉伯的西奈山，相当于现今的耶路撒冷，她和她的儿女都是奴仆。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004026",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;那天上的耶路撒冷则是自由的，是我们的母亲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004027",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;因为圣经上说： “不生育、未生养的妇人啊， 要快乐； 未曾生产的女子啊， 要高声欢呼， 因为没有丈夫的比有丈夫的儿女更多。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004028",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:28",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004028",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>28</sup>&nbsp;弟兄姊妹，你们都像以撒一样是照着上帝的应许出生的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004029",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:29",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004029",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>29</sup>&nbsp;当时，那按着人的意愿生的儿子迫害那靠着圣灵生的儿子，现在的情况也和当时一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004030",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:30",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004030",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>30</sup>&nbsp;但圣经上怎么说呢？圣经上说：“赶走婢女和她的儿子，因为婢女的儿子不能与主母的儿子一同承受产业。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048004031",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 4:31",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48004031",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>31</sup>&nbsp;弟兄姊妹，这样看来，我们不是婢女的儿女，而是主母的儿女。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;基督释放了我们，好让我们得自由。所以，要站稳了，不要再被奴仆的轭辖制。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;听着！我保罗郑重地告诉你们，如果你们接受割礼，基督对你们就毫无益处。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我再次警告所有接受割礼的人，他们必须遵守全部的律法。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;你们若想靠遵行律法被称为义人，就与基督隔绝了，并且离开了上帝的恩典。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;但我们要靠着圣灵，凭信心热切等候所盼望的义。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;因为在基督耶稣里，受不受割礼根本无关紧要，借着爱表现出来的信心才至关重要。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你们本来在信心的路上一直跑得很好。现在是谁拦阻了你们，叫你们不再信从真理呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;这种劝导当然不是出于呼召你们的上帝！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;“一点面酵能使整团面发起来。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我在主里深信你们不会有二心，但无论谁搅扰你们，都必受惩罚。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;弟兄姊妹，我如果仍旧主张行割礼，怎么还会受迫害呢？如果是那样，十字架冒犯人的地方就被消除了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我恨不得那些搅扰你们的人把自己阉了！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;弟兄姊妹，你们蒙召得了自由，但不要以自由为借口来放纵本性，要本着爱心互相服侍，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;因为全部的律法可以总结成一句话：“要爱邻如己。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你们要谨慎，如果你们相咬相吞，恐怕会同归于尽。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;因此，我劝你们行事为人要顺从圣灵的引导，这样就不会放纵本性的私欲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;因为人本性的私欲与圣灵作对，圣灵也与人本性的私欲作对，两者势不两立，使你们不能做自己想做的事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;但你们如果顺从圣灵的引导，就不在律法之下。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;顺从本性去做的事显而易见，如淫乱、污秽、邪荡、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;拜偶像、行邪术、仇恨、争斗、忌恨、恼怒、纷争、冲突、分裂、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;嫉妒、凶杀、醉酒和荒宴无度等。我从前警告过你们，现在再一次警告你们：行这些事的人必不能承受上帝的国。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;但圣灵所结的果子是仁爱、喜乐、和平、忍耐、恩慈、良善、信实、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;温柔、自制。没有律法会禁止这些事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;那些属基督耶稣的人，已经把本性及其邪情私欲都钉在十字架上了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;我们如果是靠圣灵生活，就当凡事顺从圣灵的引导。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048005026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 5:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48005026",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;我们不要自高自大，彼此惹气，互相嫉妒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;弟兄姊妹，如果有人不慎犯了罪，你们属灵的人就应该温柔地挽回他，同时也要小心，免得自己也受诱惑。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你们要分担彼此的重担，这样就成全了基督的律法。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;一个一无是处的人如果自以为了不起，就是自欺。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;人人都应该省察自己的行为，即使觉得有可夸之处，自己知道就好了，不必在别人面前炫耀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;因为人人都应该为自己的行为负责。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;在真道上受教的人应该把一切美好的东西分享给教导他的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;不要自欺，上帝是轻慢不得的。人种什么收什么。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;顺从本性撒种的，必从本性收取败坏的恶果；顺从圣灵撒种的，必从圣灵收取永生。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我们行善不可灰心气馁，因为到时候必有收获。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我们要把握机会为众人做善事，对待信徒更要如此。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;你们看，我亲手写给你们的字是多么大啊！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;那些想做表面工夫的人才勉强你们接受割礼，他们无非是怕为基督的十字架受迫害。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;那些接受割礼的人自己也不能遵行律法。他们要你们接受割礼，无非是想借着你们的肉体夸耀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;至于我自己，我绝不夸耀别的，只夸耀我们主耶稣基督的十字架。因为对我来说，世上的一切都已经被钉在十字架上；对这世界来说，我已经被钉在十字架上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;受不受割礼根本无关紧要，做一个新造的人才至关重要。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;愿上帝的平安和怜悯归给那些愿意按这原则生活的人，也归给上帝的以色列子民。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;但愿从今以后，再也没有人来搅扰我了，因为我身上已经烙上了耶稣的印记。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10048006018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "加拉太书 6:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "48006018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;弟兄姊妹，愿我们主耶稣基督的恩典与你们的灵同在。阿们！</p>"
  }
]